UI PLAYER 1 is down!
UI Press F to revive your partner (uses a medkit)
CALL rk XApplyEffectOnPlayer Nola_ReviveNoBag
LOG NOLA LIFE: parceiro caido ao alcance: efeito Nola_ReviveNoBag aplicado (F reanima e nao abre o inventario) ok=true
LOG NOLA LIFE: itens de reanimar (Item.WoundedHeal): 3
CALL itemRemove P Medkit 1 -> true
LOG NOLA LIFE: REANIMAR: F perto do outro jogador caido (100 cm): 1 Medkit consumido (tinha 3), pedido #1 enviado
UI Reviving your partner…
OUT inv Medkit=2
OUT #RV:1,0
CALL itemRefund Medkit
UI Revive rejected: your medkit was returned.
UI_CLEAR revprompt
OUT inv Medkit=3
OUT inv Medkit=3
